window.products.push({"id":125101,"name":"Pour Over Coffee Maker Kit with Coffee Dripper, Reusable Stainless Steel Filter, Heat Resistant Borosilicate Glass Carafe 600ml and Silicone Handle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711wpFfU0aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A. PRECISE DRIPPER WITH HONEYCOMB DESIGN Fine mesh stainless steel filter, reusable, eco-friendly and easily clean, never need for one-time-use paper filters which could promotes the pure unfolding of the flavor and keep the essential oils and flavors of coffee effectively. B. BOROSILICATE GLASS CARAFE The carafe is made with borosilicate glass, which is with great temperature-resistant glass. 600ml capacity for single or 3-4 people enjoy. C. EASILY ENJOY Even though the glass pot is inconvenient to carry, the coffee drip cone is compact and lightweight, safe for carry with you, and it is with a steady stand which make it fit for most size cups or bottles, easily enjoy cups of coffee/tea at anytime and anywhere, like at home, work, traveling, picnic, hiking or camping. D. GET A CUP OF COFFEE IN 5-10 MINUTES -Fill stainless steel filter with desired amount of coffee ground.(Medium or medium fine grind works best.) -Slowly pour (in a circular motion) 195°F to 205°F water to wet all of the coffee grounds, pause and slowly pour the remaining hot water into the filter. -For the best possible flavor, let it brew for about 4 minutes, then Pour out and enjoy. Package includes: -1 x Coffee filter -1 x Filter stand -1 x Glass carafe Note: 1. Please allow 0.4’’-0.8\" size error due to manual measurement. 2. If you want to know more information with this coffee maker kit or have any questions about the product, please feel free to email us, we will reply within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711wpFfU0aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sanasic","source_asin":"B07QYVJD2F","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-125101","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QYVJD2F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QYVJD2F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
