window.products.push({"id":125177,"name":"Amana 6.5 cu. ft. Traditional Gas Dryer with Automatic Dryness Control, NGD4600YQ, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TLs9WcwOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Product Description Amana 6.5 cu. ft. Gas Dryer Have drying options that match your wardrobe with this dryer featuring eleven cycles and three temperatures, including an Energy Preferred cycle and Air Dry option. The Wrinkle Prevent option helps put a stop to wrinkles. After the load is finished, clothes tumble intermittently without heat to help prevent wrinkles from forming. Plus, if you prefer more control, there are three timed dry choices from 20 to 60 minutes. Product Features Additional Features 6.5 - Cubic Foot Capacity With 6.5 cubic foot capacity, there's room for more in every load so you'll be able to finish the laundry faster and move on to things you'd rather do. Modern Styling Create a laundry room as chic as your wardrobe. The contemporary lines and unique accent colors on the console give you a look that's tailored to perfection. Wrinkle Prevent Option Put a stop to wrinkles. After the load is finished, clothes tumble intermittently without heat to help stop wrinkles from forming. Automatic Dryness Control You don't have to worry. Sensors monitor temperature, automatically stopping the cycle when fabrics are dry, to help reduce shrinking and over drying. Energy Preferred Cycle Dry efficiently with this automatic cycle. Help save energy by using this dryness level as a great starting point for drying most fabrics. Timed Dry Cycles Forgo the cycle selection, and choose a dry time that matches the load from 20 to 60 minutes. 11 dryer cycles 11 dryer cycles 3 temperature settings 3 temperature settings Super-wide opening, reversible-swing door Super-wide opening, reversible-swing door Matching Appliances Amana 3.4 - Cubic Foot Top-Load Washer NTW4600YQ Parts & Accessories Gas Hook-Up Kit #20-48KITRC This kit contains everything you need to get your gas dryer going—a stainless gas connector, pipe thread sealant, the proper fitting and a leak test solution. Dryer Vent Installer Kit #4396013RB Keep it flowing with safe and efficient metal venting. A four-foot vent section attaches to a close elbow, while another attaches to a wall offset. Plus, an extension collar takes it to greater lengths. Dryer Vent Cleaning Brush #8212614 Help lower utility bills, reduce drying time and extend the life of your dryer by thoroughly removing lint on a regular basis. Great for dryers with top-mounted lint screens. Before You Buy Does your current dryer cook your clothes? How often do items come out just a little bit smaller? Don't worry, we've got it under control with Automatic Dryness Control. Amana dryers monitor temperatures so you don't have to. Clothes get the attention they need and come out dry—but not smaller. Is it often a challenge to load and unload your current dryer? Stop the struggle with an Aman dryer. The side-swing dryer door features a wide opening. You can even reverse the way the dryer door opens for extra convenience. Would you like a laundry room that has a little style? With contemporary lines and unique accent colors on the console, Amana top load laundry pairs add a little something to any room. Do clothes come out more wrinkled than you expected when using your current dryer? The Wrinkle Prevent option intermittently tumbles clothes without heat once the cycle is over so clothes come out less wrinkled and more ready-to-wear. Dimensions Things to Consider Tip #1 Measure the space for your new dryer (or laundry pair) as well as any doorways or hallways the appliances must fit through. Tip #2 Make sure the floor is level, with no more than a one-inch slope. Tip #3 If installing a laundry pair, ensure that there are hot and cold water lines within three feet of washer hookups. Tip #4 Don't forget that your gas dryer will need an approved gas line with shut off valve. Warranty Information Limited One Year Warranty — Parts and Labor — For one (1) year from the original retail purchase date, any part that fails in normal home use will be repaired or replaced free of charge. Refer to amana.com or the individual product Use and Care Guide for warranty details. From the Manufacturer Have drying options that match your wardrobe with this dryer featuring 11 cycles and 3 temperatures including an Energy Preferred cycle and Air dry option. The Wrinkle Prevent option helps put a stop to wrinkles. After the load is finished, clothes tumble intermittently without heat to help prevent wrinkles from forming. Plus, if you prefer more control, there are 3 timed dry choices from 20-60 minutes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TLs9WcwOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AMANA","source_asin":"B007P4WAWU","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-125177","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007P4WAWU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B007P4WAWU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
