window.products.push({"id":125197,"name":"3406107 Dryer Door Switch by Beaquicy - Replacement for Whirlpool, Ken-More, Roper, Amana, Crosley Dryer (1-Pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.87,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xrY73LmDL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"【𝟯𝟰𝟬𝟲𝟭𝟬𝟳 𝗗𝗥𝗬𝗘𝗥 𝗗𝗢𝗢𝗥 𝗦𝗪𝗜𝗧𝗖𝗛】:3406107 dryer door switch is replacement part for a dryer.This switch has a ABS PLASTIC actuator. Door switch 3406107 has 3 Wire Leads with a Plug as Pictured.Acts as a safety switch that indicates and halts operation when the door is open or when a belt is broken on some units.It used to keep the dryer from operating when the dryer door is open. Part is housed on the inside of the appliance door. Product is plastic and white. ▶Electrical Specs: 120-240V, 50-60Hz, 11A, 1/3HP. 【𝗘𝗻𝘀𝘂𝗿𝗲 𝘀𝗮𝗳𝗲 𝗼𝗽𝗲𝗿𝗮𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻 𝗼𝗳 𝗰𝗹𝗼𝘁𝗵𝗲𝘀 𝗱𝗿𝘆𝗲𝗿】:The dryer door switch WP3406107 is an essential safety feature in the dryer, as it prevents the dryer from operating while the door is open.Without 3406107 door switch, the dryer may continue to operate after the dryer door is opened, which could create a risk of injury or damage to the machine.☞You can test the 3406107 switch for damage with an ohmmeter by first disconnecting the wire on the switch, setting the multimeter to an ohmmeter value, testing the switch by touching the two terminals of the switch with the probe of the multimeter, and checking the reading. If the switch is faulty, replace it in time. 【𝗦𝘂𝗶𝘁𝗮𝗯𝗹𝗲 𝗳𝗼𝗿 𝗮 𝘃𝗮𝗿𝗶𝗲𝘁𝘆 𝗼𝗳 𝗯𝗿𝗮𝗻𝗱𝘀 𝗼𝗳 𝗱𝗿𝘆𝗲𝗿】:3406107 dryer door switch Replacement for Whirl-pool, Ken-more, Roper, Amana, Crosley and more brand dryer.▶Fit for 𝑾𝒉𝒊𝒓𝒍𝒑𝒐𝒐𝒍 len2000kq1, lgc8858eq2, lgq8858hq1, lgr5620kq1, lgr8648lq0, 7mlgq8000jq5, 7ewed1510ym0, 7mggq9800ml0, 7mgx4626ez0, 7mwed1600bm0, 7mwg66700sq0, 7mwgd1500aq0, 8blgr5636jq0, 1cwed5100vq1,etc.▶Fit for 𝑴𝒂𝒚𝒕𝒂𝒈 7mmedx550xw0, 7mmep0080ww1, 7mmgd6630tm0, 7mmge7973tw0, 7mmgl6741tw0, medp475ew0,etc.▶Fit for 𝑲𝒆𝒏𝒎𝒐𝒓𝒆 11074956300, 11074964300, 11074966300, 11074972301, 11074976301, 11074992301, 11074994301, 11074996300, 11074996301, 11075062500, 11079727801, 11079732800, etc. 【𝟯𝟲𝟱 𝗗𝗔𝗬𝗦 𝗪𝗔𝗥𝗥𝗔𝗡𝗧𝗬】:The product 3406107 dryer door switch supports 365 days RETURN and EXCHANGE.Our company attaches great importance to the shopping experience of each customer.Risk-free shopping, If you have any quality problem during warranty period, please contact customer service in time.▶Dryer Switch 3406107 Replaces part numbers 3406107, 3405101, 3405100, 3406101, 3406100, 3406109, WP3406107VP, 528948, AP6008561, PS11741701, EAP11741701, 110.62064101, 110.77622600, etc.Please check the compatibility with your previous part and appliance's model before ordering this replacement. 【𝗘𝗔𝗦𝗬 𝗧𝗢 𝗜𝗡𝗦𝗧𝗔𝗟𝗟】:You may have a faulty 3406107 dryer door switch if your dryer not start, not shut off, not tumble, no heat, not enough heat.☞Please disconnect the dryer from power Before you install the 3406107 dryer door switch, and wear work gloves to protect your hands. Door Switch 3406107 is usually located near the top of the door opening, and it is held in place by two screws. The tools you'll need are Phillips screwdriver, Putty knife, and Slot screwdriver. you don't need a professional repairman to fix it.If you're not sure how to install it, you can learn from the YouTube,there are more details on it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xrY73LmDL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B083PWPVFX","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-125197","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083PWPVFX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B083PWPVFX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
