window.products.push({"id":125305,"name":"KitchenAid Architect II 4-Burner Downdraft Gas Cooktop (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SE15fgaJL._AC_SL1290_.jpg","description":"This 30-inch downdraft cooktop gives you the versatility to install the cooktop in an island or peninsula without the need for a separate ventilation system. The built-in downdraft vent helps capture smoke, steam, and odors right at the surface. And with four burners, you can do everything from simmering to stir-frying with a range of high-to-low heat outputs. Full-Width Cast-Iron Grates with Gloss Finish Allow easy movement of cookware around the entire cooking surface and have a gloss finish that complements the ceramic glass surface. 325 CFM Exhaust Rating Helps you maintain a pleasant living environment during every cooking application, from pan searing to stir-frying. 15K BTU Professional Burner Reaches the high temperatures required to quickly get liquids to a boil and for high-temperature cooking techniques including getting a great sear on meat. Additional Features 5K BTU Simmer Burner Is perfect for cooking foods at low temperatures and melting delicate foods like chocolate. 2-Speed Fan Control Allows you to match the ventilation power to effectively remove steam, grease, and odors from the air. LP Conversion Kit Included Allows you to convert the cooktop so it can be used with LP gas.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SE15fgaJL._AC_SL1290_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KitchenAid","source_asin":"B003FJBOZS","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-125305","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003FJBOZS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B003FJBOZS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":125306,"name":"UPGRADED WPW10671238 W10671238 Refrigerator Drawer Slide Rail, Fridge Crisper Drawer Center Rail Compatible with Whirlpool, Kenmore, Maytag, Amana Ref","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Xg2HvHipL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Upgraded Refrigerator Drawer Slide Rail】This WPW10671238 Center Crisper Rail part is the crisper drawer slide rail which helps to support the crisper drawers in your refrigerator.W10671238 refrigerator center slide rail is made of high quality and eco-friendly materials,it has higher tenacity and greater carrying capacity,last longer,meet or exceeds OEM standards,It holds up well with weight.Fixes the following symptoms:Door won’t open or close, Noisy, Leaking. 【W10671238 Crisper Drawer Center Rail】Replace Part Number : WPW10671238 refrigerator drawer slide replaces 12530701, 12530701N, 8208354, 67001057, W10671238, W10671238N, 3447456, AP6023702, PS11757048,EAP11757048.Please measure your old Refrigerator door shelf Center Rail to make sure the length is 13\", otherwise W10671238 Shelf Center Rail DON’T FIT your refrigerator! 【WPW10671238 Fridge Drawer Center Rail Compatible With】Refrigerator Center crisper drawer rail is compatible with Whirlpool, Kenmore,Maytag, Amana, KitchenAid, Crosley, Inglis, Ikea, JennAir, Sears refrigerators, MBF1958WEW1, GX2FHDXVQ03, AFB2234WEB0, etc.Please confirm these measurements before ordering.Use Ctrl+F to find your appliance model number listed on product page. 【Repalce W10671238 Drawer Center Rail】WPW10671238 Refrigerator Crisper Drawer Slide Rail replacement which is intended to replace a broken or defective center crisper rail on multiple different models of refrigerators. If the crisper drawer is not closing and opening properly, the center crisper rail may need to be replaced. Replacing this part is easy and does not require any tools.Perfect fit, exact match to original for your Whirlpool fridge. 【Package & Warranty】Refrigerator Drawer Center Rail W10671238 for 365-Days warranty. Please contact us at any time if the there is any problem in the product, damaged or not fit. We provide full after-sales service and will try our best to solve the problem.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Xg2HvHipL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ALVAR","source_asin":"B0BFB6S3QG","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-125306","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFB6S3QG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFB6S3QG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
