window.products.push({"id":125337,"name":"Waterspecialist 5231JA2002A Refrigerator Water Filter, Replacement for LG® LT500P®, ADQ72910911, GEN11042FR-08, LFX25974ST, ADQ72910901, ADQ72910907, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71O9gTLuUsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Waterspecialist refrigerator water filter features filtration performance is comparable to the original brand. It is also certified by authority NSF 42 and 372. Far different from generic brand, Waterspecialist only adopts 100% superior coconut shell carbon block to improve taste and odor. Great filtration: Waterspecialist refrigerator filters can reduce many harmful substances in water including heavy metals, mercury, chlorine, odor, THM, VOCs (volatile organic compounds), particles, copper, cadmium, chromium, and all other major impurities. This has been tested and proven by an independent third-party laboratory. Premium filter material: We also adopt 100% natural coconut shell carbon block that contains larger surface area and more micropores than inferior carbon block. Thus, the filter cartridge can efficiently reduce chlorine, bad taste and odor. Perfect fit: Waterspecialist combines precision measurement technology to produce 100% fit refrigerator filters with exquisite engineering designs, unlike inferior replacement filters that can cause water leakage issues. Also, Waterspecialist saves you time and hassle by offering tool-free refrigerator filter replacements. Waterspecialist selected BPA-free and food-grade filter housing that passed NSF 372 certification for lead-free filtration. Monthly install stickers: Expired replacement filters might cause an accumulation of pollutants and only achieve low-standard filtration performance. Therefore, Waterspecialist filters come with date labels that remind you to change it on time. Besides, the filter life is 6 months or 300 gallons (varies based on the water condition). Responsibility: Each product manufactured by Waterspecialist, must pass extremely high examination standards. This does not stop when a filter leaves our factory: our 24/7 customer service team will provide water purification solutions and help you answer your questions at any time. Replacement for models: LG LT500P, 5231JA2002A, ADQ72910911, GEN11042FR-08, 9890, 46-9890, ADQ72910901, ADQ72910907, GEN11042F-08, 5231JA2002B, FML-1, RWF1050, 5231JA2002A-S, 5231JA2002B-S and Kenmore filters 469890, RWF1050, EFF-6005A, RWF0100A, FML-1, R-9890, WSL-1, WF-LT500P, WF290, KJ500, DWF-1. Compatible with: LFX25973SB, LFX25973ST, LFX25974ST, LFX25974SW, LMX25964ST, LRSC21934SB, LRSC21951ST, LRSP2031BS, LRSPC2031BK, LRSPC2031BS, LRSPC2031NI, LRSPC2041SW, LRSPC2051BM, LRSPC2051ST, LRSPC2331BK, LRSPC2331BS, LRSPC2331NI, LRSPC2331T, LRSPC2341SW, LRSPC2661T, LSC23924ST, LSC26905SB, LSC26905TT, LSC27914SB, LSC27914ST, LSC27914ST01, LSC27921SB05, LSC27921ST, LSC27921SWXOO, LSC27921TT. LG is a registered trademark of LG CORP. LG is used for reference purposes only.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71O9gTLuUsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Waterspecialist","source_asin":"B078W65HMQ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-125337","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078W65HMQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B078W65HMQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
