window.products.push({"id":125584,"name":"Reed Vitalizer Kit with 84% Humidity Control Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81W9Yk72D2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"From the Manufacturer The Reed Vitalizer Kit in 84% relative humidity contains one durable zip pouch for reed storage and one Reed Vitalizer humidity control pack. Each Reed Vitalizer control pack self regulates to the ideal humidity level and will last 45-60 days. When the pack becomes hard, discard and replace with a new pack. The Reed Vitalizer Humidipak technology for reed storage uses the patented Humidipak technology. This two-way humidity control helps prevent cracking and warping. Since the acquisition of Rico by D'Addario & Co., Rico has strengthened its position as the global leader in woodwind reeds and accessories. Rico's state-of-the-art reed research center in Southern California employs a collaboration of agronomists, scientists, and musicians to produce top-quality reeds, including Rico Reserve premium reeds for clarinet and saxophone. Rico reeds are designed to benefit all levels of musicians, from the beginner to the seasoned professional. Many of the world's finest woodwind players perform with Rico reeds, such as Mark Nuccio, Jerry Bergonzi, Chris Potter, Benny Golson, Ernie Watts, Bob Sheppard, Henri Bok, Richie Hawley, Eric Alexander, and many more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81W9Yk72D2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rico","source_asin":"B000G3D544","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-125584","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000G3D544","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B000G3D544","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":125585,"name":"Uber Goop WHITE Dishwasher Rack Paint & Glue w/40 caps","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31p8mGm12UL._AC_.jpg","description":"Tens and tens of thousands of people just like you have successfully used Uber Goop liquid PVC to coat their damaged dishwasher racks waterproofing them and preventing further deterioration. Plastic tine caps and Uber Goop also repair damaged rack tines and protect new racks. Vinyl tine caps have the added benefit of protecting dishes from rust stains and chipping. With proper prep, Uber Goop helps extend the life of your dishwasher racks saving you the cost of buying new ones at $60-$100 each. Uber Goop liquid pvc comes in 3 colors (White, lt. grey, dark grey) so customers can match it to the color of their dishwasher racks. Easy paint on application and dries fast. FYI: Uber Goop can be used to coat any wire product (except electrical wiring or sheet metal) where repairs are needed or it needs protecting from the elements. People use it on coated chain link fences too.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31p8mGm12UL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Uber Goop","source_asin":"B000HXH8JQ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-125585","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000HXH8JQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B000HXH8JQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
