window.products.push({"id":125719,"name":"Beaquicy WB44X5099 Oven Bake Element - Replacement for G-E Hot-point Oven - Replaces 3366, AP2031097, PS249483, EAP249483","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.27,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61l6b5j4Y9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【PRODUCT SPECIFICATIONS】--- WB44X5099 Oven Heating Element is at the bottom of the oven and supplies the heat for baking. The color is metal and black. The rated power is 2585 power and the rated voltage is 240 volts. The item measures approximately 17.6 inch width × 15.9 inch length. The space from mounting bracket to end of terminals is 1-1/2\". The space between terminals is 1-1/4\". The width of the sheet metal is 3.9 inches. The package includes 1 × WB44X5099 Range Bake Element. ✅【MADE OF PREMIUM MATERIAL】--- WB44X5099 Oven Bake Element is made of high temperature resistant nickel stainless steel alloy, which are usedrated for good strength and oxidation resistant at continuous high temperatures. This material can be used for a long time. Well-tested by manufacturer, non OEM but quality equal to OEM requirements, long service life. If the following conditions occur, replace the heating element in time: ★Little to no heat when baking; ★Will not heat; ★Worn or corroded. ✅【WIDE COMPATIBLE】--- WB44X5099 Range Bake Element can compatible with G-E, Hot-point Range Ovens. ★Replaces number: 3366, AP2031097, PS249483, EAP249483, AP7, RP44X5099, TS44X5099, WB44X0103, WB44X0105, WB44X0111, WB44X0112, WB44X0117, WB44X0118, WB44X0119, WB44X0120, WB44X0125, WB44X0126, WB44X0133, WB44X103, WB44X105, WB44X111, WB44X112, WB44X117, WB44X118, WB44X119, WB44X120, WB44X125, WB44X126, WB44X133, WB44X5083, WB44X5083R, WB44X5098, WB44X5099R, WB44X6083, WB44X6099, etc. ✅【365 DAYS WARRANTY】--- G-E oven element replacement WB44X5099 supports 365 days return and exchange. If you have any quality problem during warranty period, please contact customer service in time. We will try our best to solve the problem. Our company attaches great importance to the shopping experience of each customer. We are committed to allowing our customers to use the highest quality products at the best prices. Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit. ✅【DIY INSTALLATION】 --- Unplug your oven or turn off the circuit breaker before installing WB44X5099 g-e bake element. Prepare a pair of work gloves, needle-nosed pliers and a phillips screwdriver. Unscrewed the two screws that held the element in place,needed pliers to remove the sta-kon connectors from old element. Attached them to new element and put screws back in place. Tested unit by turning oven on for a couple minutes. You can follow the Youtube videos if you have trouble installing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61l6b5j4Y9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B087LWNDYD","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-125719","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087LWNDYD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B087LWNDYD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
