window.products.push({"id":125898,"name":"Milk Frothing Pitcher Stainless Steel 20 oz Milk Steaming Pitchers Frother Cup Jug Ideal for Espresso Cappuccino Coffee Latte Art Barista Milk Steamer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FrKdAfWZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"- Stand Out From the Crowd: As a milk jug for preparing milk froth, their lustrous colorful finish gives them a classic yet modern look. AlwaysU Milk Frothing Pitcher collection turns your coffee break into a stylish enjoyment. With a sleeker color than the average frothing pitcher, this pitcher will definitely stand out from the rest. - High Quality & Well Made: Made of durable stainless steel that is rust and corrosion resistant. Angled handle and smooth-rimmed spout promote accurate, precise pouring. - Easily Create Foam: The tapered spout makes this Stainless Steel Frothing Pitcher ideal for performing latte art. Show off your skills as a barista and impress your customers with drinks decorated just for them!  Ideal for using with a cappuccino or espresso machine to steam and froth milk or cream. Great for making lattes, cappuccinos, and other milk-based drinks. This pitcher also doubles as a way to serve cold milk or cream with coffee for tableside service. Product Content: Material: Food Grade Stainless Steel. Dimensions:  Volume: 20 oz/ounce (600ml) Height: 4.33 inch Cup Mouth Diameter: 3 inch Bottom Diameter: 3.55 inch Weight: 7.41oz A perfectly designed cup for every coffee speciality. Use this frothing pitcher to add foam and milk to a hot drink, and you can even use it to create latte art atop your beverages to increase their perceived value.  By simply moving this frothing pitcher in various motions while pouring the foam, you can create a multitude of designs like hearts, leaves, or flowers. Best of all, this pitcher also doubles as a way to serve cold milk or cream with coffee for tableside service.  Treat customers in your coffee shop or cafe to a creamy hot beverage with just the right amount of rich, smooth foam with the help of this 20 oz frothing pitcher!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FrKdAfWZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AlwaysU","source_asin":"B07TZXNM3X","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-125898","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TZXNM3X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TZXNM3X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
