window.products.push({"id":125973,"name":"WR57X10032 WR57X33326 Refrigerator Water Inlet Valve by Techecook - Dual Solenoid Compatible with GE Hotpoint Refrigerator - Replaces AP3672839 WR32X1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711YYmZj-AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High quality materials that prevents cracking and failing during the installation and use process. ✔✔【WATER VALVE WR57X10032】:G-E refrigerator water valve assembly WR57X10032 supplies water to the ice maker and water dispenser in the refrigerator. WR57X33326 WR57X10032 ge water valve for refrigerator is dual inlet water valve comes with a two-coil assembly. One to let the water to the icemaker the other to let water to the dispenser, which can double the efficiency for you ✔✔【COMPATIBLE MODEL】:WR57x10032 water inlet valve replacement fit G-E Hot-point Refrigerator. Replaces part numbers: 880070, AP3192626, WR57X10040, WR57X10064, PS304374, AH304374, EA304374, AP3672839,WV1051, PS901314,1032629, 66048,WR02X10105, WR2X10105, WR57X0092, WR57X0098, WR57X0099, WR57X0104, WR57X0111, WR57X0119, WR57X10018, WR57X10018E, WR57X104, WR57X111, WR57X119, WR57X92, WR57X98, WR57X99, AH901314,WR57X33326 water inlet valve ✔✔【HIGH QUALITY】:The WR57X33326 inlet valve is suitable for water pipe, pump dispenser or ice maker kit and can repair the phenomenon of ice and water on the refrigerator door. The replacement ge wr57x10032 water valve is made by durable high quality material and well-tested by the manufacturer before leaving the factory. Fast official Amazon logistics. The excellent quality and the best price help you have a better quality of life ✔✔【365 DAYS WARRANTY】:Risk-free shopping. If Solenoid valve WR57X10032 WR57X33326 ge water valve has any quality problems, we support to return, replacement or refund. We are committed to providing the highest quality products and best prices to ensure the highest quality life for you. Customers' satisfaction is our unremitting pursuit. The WR57X33326 imported valve replacement kit effectively utilizes electricity to restore maximum performance to your refrigerator ✔✔【DIY INSTALLATION】:Unplug and turn off the power supply to the drying machine before making any repairs. If your water dispenser leaked water or if the cold water is not coming out of the water dispenser, or if the ice maker won't dispense ice, Please check and replace water valve AP3672839 in time. You will need tools includes crescent wrench, screwdriver to install this ge part WR57X10032 Refrigerator Dual Solenoid Water Inlet Valve. You can find the repair video on the Internet and follow it to install WR57X10032 ge inlet valve","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711YYmZj-AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Techecook","source_asin":"B098SRJ9P1","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-125973","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098SRJ9P1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B098SRJ9P1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
